SUMMARY:2nd New Restaurant Tryout: Manor Buffet\, Food and Discussion🥙
 🍹
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Freethought Society\nSeafood\, hibachi\, sushi\, ste
 ak\, and more!\nWe are trying out some new restaurants this month... Manor
  Buffet is an all-you-can-eat Asian buffet featuring Chinese\, Korean\, Ja
 panese\, Italian\, and American food. Looking for your thoughts on the foo
 d\, the location\, and this restaurant as a prospective\, regular venue fo
 r LFS.\n\nEveryone is expected to support the restaurant\, and we will eac
 h be responsible for our own checks. Bring a friend!\n\nEnjoy dinner and d
 iscussion at Manor Buffet with us\, 6:00pm\, Sunday November 22nd.\n\nMano
 r Buffet\n2090 Lincoln Hwy E\nLancaster\, PA 17602
